537
00:40:26.410 --> 00:40:29.997
You are the blood
of Old Valyria.

538
00:40:31.540 --> 00:40:33.375
You answer
to higher gods than his.

539
00:40:37.880 --> 00:40:40.549
To them. this house...

540
00:40:41.842 --> 00:40:44.386
